      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Mission:\n\u25BA Charge ATP: \"Grab\" nutritions and bring it to the mitochondria
    so that it generates energy (ATP)\r.\n\u25BA Duplicate Centriole: Once the energy
    (ATP) has been fully charged, \"grab\" the centriole and slowly position it away.
    And wait for 3 seconds to see what's happening next."
