  m_text: 'Look at the arm in front of you!

    There is a scar... and it looks
    painful  :(


    You can heal that wound by doing a role of chromosome in the
    mitosis process!


    If you touch the scar for three seconds, you will be dive
    into the skin cell. Let''s do this!!!'
